          "id": "gnoi-packet-link-qualification-packet-injector-configuration",
          "kind": "message",
          "label": "gnoi.packet_link_qualification.PacketInjectorConfiguration",
          "description": "A packet injector implementation defines that the generator side of the link\nwill be responsible for both setting the interface into a loopback as well\nas injecting individual packets up to packet_count into the closed loop at\nthe packet_size. These packets will form a closed loop as both sides of the\nloop will forward the same set of packets for the duration of the\nqualification.",
          "sourceSymbol": "gnoi.packet_link_qualification.PacketInjectorConfiguration",
