          "description": "UploadRequest instructs the target to store the given gRPC-level\nAuthorization Policy.\n\nAn UploadRequest must fail, if there is an active RotateAuthzRequest RPC\nstream.",
          "sourceSymbol": "gnsi.authz.v1.UploadRequest",
