              "id": "ak-creation-data",
              "type": "bytes",
              "name": "ak_creation_data",
              "description": "The AK attestation key creation data `TPM2B_CREATION_DATA` structure. See\nsection 24.1 of\nhttps://trustedcomputinggroup.org/wp-content/uploads/TCG_TPM2_r1p59_Part3_Commands_pub.pdf#page=293 protolint:disable:this MAX_LINE_LENGTH\nand section 15.2 of\nhttps://trustedcomputinggroup.org/wp-content/uploads/TCG_TPM2_r1p59_Part2_Structures_pub.pdf#page=176. protolint:disable:this MAX_LINE_LENGTH",
